{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122309","id":4254787748,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc79muik","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122309","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122309.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122309.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122309","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122309/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122309/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122309/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b162cd9a0884acfdd6d5ae2a0fdacc62b4001537","number":122309,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve selected item contrast for ItemList in the Modern editor theme","user":{"login":"Lianomeister","id":177645684,"node_id":"U_kgDOCpaodA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177645684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister","html_url":"https://github.com/Lianomeister","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lianomeister/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- In the Modern editor theme, `ItemList`'s `selected` / `hovered_selected` styleboxes reused the neutral `flat_button_pressed` color, which is only a slightly darker shade of the base background.\n- This makes it hard to tell which item is currently selected vs. merely hovered — most noticeable in the Script editor's script list on the left, where it's difficult to see which script is currently open.\n- The Classic theme already highlights selection with an accent-tinted `highlight_color`; this brings the same idea to the Modern theme's `ItemList`, at a reduced opacity so it isn't overly strong against Modern's flatter look.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Built the editor locally (`scons platform=windows target=editor`) with the Modern theme.\n- [x] Opened multiple scripts in the Script editor and confirmed the currently selected script in the file list is now clearly distinguishable from hovered/unselected items.\n- [x] Checked Classic theme is unaffected (change is scoped to `theme_modern.cpp`).","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-11T15:56:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T16:00:15Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T16:00:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"32739cb5e6f7246077057ad0fa75e2348fbeeb6a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Lianomeister:fix/modern-theme-itemlist-selected-contrast","ref":"fix/modern-theme-itemlist-selected-contrast","repo":{"id":1305631986,"node_id":"R_kgDOTdJc8g","name":"godot","full_name":"Lianomeister/godot","ow